#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1237
msgid ""
"For example, a value for α between 0.2 and 0.3 represents 20 to 30 percent "
"error adjustment in the prior forecast."
msgstr ""
"Ett värde på α mellan 0,2 och 0,3 innebär till exempel att föregående "
"prognosfel korrigeras med 20–30 procent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1241
msgid ""
"If you choose to have the tool enter formulæ rather than values into the "
"output region, then you can modify the damping factor α even after you "
"executed the tool."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer att verktyget ska skriva in formler i stället för värden i "
"utdataområdet kan du ändra dämpningsfaktorn α även efter att verktyget har "
"körts."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1246
msgid ""
"To have the standard errors output as well, check the "
"<quote><guilabel>Standard error</guilabel></quote> check box. The formula "
"used is given in <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-formula-hunter-"
"stderr\"/>. The denominator can be adjusted by selecting the appropriate "
"radio button. Since there are <parameter>t−1</parameter> terms in the sum of"
" the denominator, selecting <quote><guilabel>n−1</guilabel></quote> means "
"that the denominator will be <parameter>t−2</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"Markera kryssrutan <quote><guilabel>Standardfel</guilabel></quote> om "
"standardfelen också ska visas. Formeln finns i <xref linkend=\"exp-"
"smoothing-tool-formula-hunter-stderr\"/>. Du kan ändra nämnaren med "
"motsvarande alternativknapp. Eftersom summan i nämnaren innehåller "
"<parameter>t−1</parameter> termer innebär valet "
"<quote><guilabel>n−1</guilabel></quote> att nämnaren blir "
"<parameter>t−2</parameter>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1257
msgid ""
"The Standard Error Formula For Exponential Smoothing According To Hunter"
msgstr "Formel för standardfel vid exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1259
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"hunter-stderr.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>The"
" formula used to calculate the standard error of exponential smoothing "
"according to Hunter </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"hunter-stderr.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Formeln för att beräkna standardfelet vid exponentiell utjämning "
"enligt Hunter</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1273 C/gnumeric.xml:1391
msgid ""
"If you check the <quote><guilabel>Include chart</guilabel></quote> check "
"box, a line graph showing the observations "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> and the predicted values "
"<parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> will also be created."
msgstr ""
"Om du markerar kryssrutan <quote><guilabel>Inkludera "
"diagram</guilabel></quote> skapas även ett linjediagram som visar "
"observationerna <parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> och de "
"prognostiserade värdena <parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter>."

